    {
      "id": "iczzawm",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1.3 Arrival of Europeans"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tu5l92b",
      "content": "Vasco da Gama landed at Kappad (Kozhikode) on May 27, 1498, marking the beginning of the European era in Kerala. This was the first direct sea route from Europe to India."
    },
