    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rrs5kf4",
      "content": "Rama Varma (Dharmaraja) (1758–1798) and later Rani Gowri Lakshmi Bayi were notable rulers. The kingdom came under British paramountcy through the Travancore-British treaty."
