      "content": "1.5 Social Reform Movements in Kerala"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "p8o8sjm",
      "content": "Kerala has a rich tradition of social reform movements that fought against caste discrimination, untouchability, and social inequality. These movements paved the way for the progressive nature of Kerala's society today."
