    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Vasco da Gama landed at Kappad (Calicut) on May 20, 1498, during the reign of the Zamorin.",
        "The Battle of Colachel (1741) resulted in Marthanda Varma of Travancore defeating the Dutch forces.",
        "Kerala State was formally inaugurated on November 1, 1956 (celebrated as Kerala Piravi) under the States Reorganisation Act."
      ],
      "id": "6ytp26e"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8jw2a5q",
      "content": "Kerala's freedom struggle was deeply intertwined with the national movement and the regional social reform movements. Important events and personalities shaped the trajectory of independence movement in Kerala."
